# Monorepo architecture

Public packages: `packages/*`. Private tooling: `packages-private/*`.

```text
compiler-sfc → compiler-dom → compiler-core → shared
                     ↓
vue → runtime-dom → runtime-core → reactivity → shared
```

## Import rules

- Import by package name (`@vue/runtime-core`), never relative into another package's `src/`.
- Compiler ↛ runtime and runtime ↛ compiler (do not expand existing type-only exceptions casually).
- Share utilities via `@vue/shared`.
- Value-import / re-export edges must appear in the importer's `package.json` dependencies.
- Do not pull compiler-only `@vue/shared` helpers (e.g. `isHTMLTag`, `isSVGTag`) into runtime builds.

## Placement

| Area | Location |
| --- | --- |
| Public runtime APIs | `packages/runtime-core/src/api*.ts` |
| VDOM / components | `packages/runtime-core/src/component*.ts`, `renderer.ts`, `vnode.ts` |
| Reactivity | `packages/reactivity/src/` |
| Compiler pipeline / transforms | `packages/compiler-core/src/` |
| DOM runtime | `packages/runtime-dom/src/` |
| Unit tests | colocated `__tests__/**/*.spec.ts` |
| DTS tests | `packages-private/dts-test/` |
